{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>八分鐘國際新聞重點｜字節跳動否認洽購談判／釜山鯊魚多次引導回外海失敗</strong></p><p>・字節跳動否認洽購<br>・釜山鯊魚誘導失敗<br>・內容只有新聞標題<br>・缺乏詳細內文支持<br>・無法核實談判內容<br>・無法確認鯊魚品種</p><p>暫時未能從TVB 新聞擷取全文。</p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1202253-八分鐘國際新聞重點字節跳動否認洽購談判釜山鯊魚多次引導回外海失敗\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">閱讀原文</a></p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:20:38.568613+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"minimal","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T14:12:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T17:17:54.246562+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:17:54.246562+00:00","content_hash":"bd315d023df1f51f88cb960026bca6c8aed31b8c7990dcf6970080ffc30fd5ea","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}